{"id":"med-tree-root","name":{"en":"Med Tree Root","ja":"薬木の根っこ"},"desc":{"en":"The medicinal root of a certain plant. It's only found deep in the soil, so a lot of effort goes into unearthing it. But it's definitely worth it.","ja":"薬用成分を含んだ木の根っこ。地中深くまで 掘らないと採れないので、採取するのに一苦 労する。その後材料にするために、よく水洗 いして陰干ししてと、さらに苦労する羽目に。"},"level":4,"locations":[{"id":"arland-great-plains","name":{"en":"Arland Great Plains","ja":"アーランド南方大平原"}},{"id":"arland-area","name":{"en":"Arland Area","ja":"アーランド周辺地域"}}],"categories":[{"id":"healing","name":{"en":"(Healing)","ja":"（薬品）"},"icon":"totori-category-healing"},{"id":"mystery","name":{"en":"(Mystery)","ja":"（神秘の力）"},"icon":"totori-category-mystery"},{"id":"plant","name":{"en":"(Plant)","ja":"（植物類）"},"icon":"totori-category-plant"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":11}